g|chopped]]\n*4 [[Cookbook:Celery|celery]] stalks, [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:carrot|carrots]], chopped\n*1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] dried [[Cookbook:Tarragon|tarragon]]\n*3 [[Cookbook:potato|potatoes]], boiled and smashed\n*8 [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounces]] [[Cookbook:Smoked Salmon|smoked salmon]], crumbled\n*½ [[Cookbook:Gallon|gallon]] salmon/fish [[Cookbook:Stock|stock]]\n*½ gallon [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n*1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Place stock pot over medium heat, add oil.\n#Add carrots, onions, celery, stirring until onions turn clear.\n#Add tarragon and salmon stock to [[Cookbook:Deglazing|deglaze]] bottom of pan.\n#Stir in smashed potatoes, smoked salmon. Continue to stir and bring to a [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]].\n#Add milk and pepper.\n#Serve and enjoy.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n\n* Vegetable stock can be substituted.\n* Additional seafood can be added.\n* Frozen veggies can be added.\n* [[Cookbook:Parsley|Parsley]] or [[Cookbook:Dill|dill]] can be used as garnish.\n* [[Cookbook:Paprika|Paprika]] or [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne]] will add some spice!\n\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salmon]]\n[[Category:Recipes for chowder]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Native American recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish broth and stock]]\n[[Category:Recipes using canola oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Smoked Salmon Chowder","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 tbsp grape seed/safflower/canola oil","sourceText":"2 tbsp grape seed/safflower/canola oil","amountText":"2 tbsp grape seed/safflower/canola oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 onions, chopped","sourceText":"2 onions, chopped","amountText":"2 onions, chopped","amount":null,"unit":